WEBVTT

00:22.080 --> 00:23.850
Are you sure? I can't believe it.

00:23.850 --> 00:27.630
I thought it was just a rumor myself, 
but it's apparently true.

00:27.630 --> 00:28.550
Oh my!

01:16.280 --> 01:17.550
Leticia?

01:27.320 --> 01:32.990
<b>I Want to Escape from Princess Lessons</b>

01:48.120 --> 01:50.020
John! Here, boy!

01:55.390 --> 01:57.060
That tickles!

01:58.670 --> 01:59.970
My.

02:23.390 --> 02:25.420
John! And a duckie!

02:26.820 --> 02:28.160
Leticia.

02:28.160 --> 02:29.670
Yes, Mother?

02:29.950 --> 02:31.480
Come now, get up.

02:31.480 --> 02:33.380
Okay! Upsy-daisy...

02:33.380 --> 02:34.490
What's going on?

02:35.050 --> 02:37.260
I have some wonderful news for you.

02:37.260 --> 02:38.430
What is it?

02:39.000 --> 02:41.180
Your future has been decided.

02:41.180 --> 02:43.140
What do you mean?

02:45.110 --> 02:49.650
What a joyous day this is! 
I must see to the preparations.

02:50.240 --> 02:53.900
Wuh? Father, are we going somewhere?

02:54.340 --> 02:58.910
Lettie, you're going to the castle 
to learn how to be a good wife.

02:59.330 --> 03:00.480
The castle?

03:00.480 --> 03:01.560
That's right.

03:01.560 --> 03:02.870
Can John come with me?!

03:04.440 --> 03:07.080
Are you coming, Father? What about Mother?

03:07.500 --> 03:10.590
Lettie, I'm afraid you'll be going without us.

03:11.290 --> 03:13.660
Wuh? But why?

03:16.270 --> 03:17.180
Come here.

03:19.230 --> 03:23.270
You'll be all right, Lettie. 
I'm sure everything will be just fine.

03:29.370 --> 03:31.830
Nadir, take good care of Lettie, won't you?

03:31.830 --> 03:33.370
Yes, Mother.

03:33.370 --> 03:35.440
Should I come with you?

03:35.440 --> 03:37.490
Please refrain, Father.

03:37.780 --> 03:39.550
You're so coldhearted...

03:39.550 --> 03:43.140
We'll be able to see them when we have
an audience with the king and queen.

03:43.140 --> 03:45.700
But that's still a long way off!

04:26.680 --> 04:27.760
Leticia.

04:29.390 --> 04:30.120
Leticia.

04:30.120 --> 04:31.240
Yeah?

04:32.050 --> 04:33.090
We've arrived.

05:01.860 --> 05:02.980
That's her right there.

05:02.980 --> 05:03.680
Oh?

05:03.680 --> 05:04.610
Hmm?

05:10.740 --> 05:11.590
Wuh?

05:14.470 --> 05:16.580
Uh, Brother Nadir?

05:17.120 --> 05:18.800
Lady Leticia Dorman.

05:18.800 --> 05:20.010
Huh?

05:20.540 --> 05:22.010
That will not do.

05:23.460 --> 05:27.260
Pay close attention. A proper 
greeting is the most basic of skills.

05:27.260 --> 05:30.570
As one of high standing, 
not to mention a lady,

05:30.570 --> 05:33.710
you must be able to speak clearly 
and give a proper greeting,

05:33.710 --> 05:37.020
all while maintaining the correct posture.

05:37.510 --> 05:43.650
I have been charged with your lessons, 
Lady Leticia. My name is Laila Mayer.

05:45.870 --> 05:48.670
Um, I'm Leticia.

05:48.670 --> 05:49.760
Another try.

05:50.610 --> 05:52.380
Come here, Lady Leticia.

05:53.180 --> 05:54.240
Quickly.

05:54.240 --> 05:55.130
Yes, ma'am.

05:59.080 --> 06:01.530
I bid you repeat after me.

06:01.530 --> 06:05.180
"I am the daughter of Duke Dorman. 
My name is Leticia."

06:05.730 --> 06:07.220
Now you.

06:07.870 --> 06:13.230
I am the daughter of Duke Dorman. 
M-My name is Leticia.

06:13.490 --> 06:17.480
You're too quiet and you're 
stammering. That will not do.

06:17.810 --> 06:18.740
Again.

06:18.740 --> 06:20.400
Huh? Wuh?

06:20.400 --> 06:24.260
You will stop grunting in such 
an oafish manner. Mind yourself.

06:25.040 --> 06:26.020
Wuh?

06:29.030 --> 06:30.730
Crying will not change a thing.

06:30.730 --> 06:34.490
Father! Mother!

06:33.490 --> 06:37.030
Do you truly believe this behavior 
befitting of a future queen?

06:47.780 --> 06:52.260
Listen, Leticia. You have to take
 your princess lessons.

06:52.560 --> 06:55.100
But I hate it when scary people yell at me!

06:55.530 --> 06:58.100
I know it's difficult, 
but you must learn to endure.

06:58.100 --> 07:00.360
No! I want to go home!

07:02.410 --> 07:04.570
If you try to run, 
they'll be even more strict.

07:04.570 --> 07:05.520
But...

07:05.520 --> 07:06.500
Leticia!

07:07.220 --> 07:09.950
It's already been decided. Understand?

07:11.010 --> 07:11.890
Okey.

07:11.890 --> 07:13.410
No, not "okey."

07:14.330 --> 07:15.290
Yes.

07:16.000 --> 07:18.400
Good. Now then, try to do your best.

07:18.780 --> 07:20.750
Lily, would you come here?

07:21.490 --> 07:22.730
Lily?

07:22.730 --> 07:23.920
I leave her to you now.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.350
Very well, my lord.

07:29.930 --> 07:32.210
My name is Lily Staehr.

07:32.680 --> 07:36.650
From now on, I shall be 
attending you, Lady Leticia.

07:37.190 --> 07:38.900
Wuh?

07:39.290 --> 07:42.940
What did you study today, my lady?

07:42.940 --> 07:46.900
Um, how to give a proper greeting.

07:47.210 --> 07:52.660
Well then, why don't I help you review 
today's lesson and practice for tomorrow?

07:52.660 --> 07:53.630
Okey.

07:53.630 --> 07:55.300
No, not "okey."

07:55.300 --> 07:56.390
Y-Yes!

08:04.980 --> 08:07.340
My lady, please wake up.

08:07.340 --> 08:08.750
My lady!

08:08.750 --> 08:09.950
Yesh?

08:09.950 --> 08:12.120
Good morning, my lady.

08:12.120 --> 08:14.550
Goo' morney...

08:14.550 --> 08:18.060
From now on, you will be going 
to the castle daily for your lessons.

08:18.060 --> 08:20.840
You should wake up early 
to prepare for your day.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.070
That will not do.

08:24.720 --> 08:26.770
Hold your hands gently in front of you.

08:30.450 --> 08:32.410
Relax your shoulders.

08:33.950 --> 08:37.080
Tighten up your stomach. Gracefully.

08:37.630 --> 08:40.850
Look straight ahead as if gazing far away.

08:40.850 --> 08:41.830
Yes, ma'am.

08:42.430 --> 08:46.650
Very good. Now you shall learn 
to walk with proper posture.

08:48.130 --> 08:52.500
You must not let the book fall. 
Keep your body steady as you walk.

08:52.500 --> 08:53.600
As I walk...

08:57.470 --> 08:59.710
This will certainly not do.

08:59.710 --> 09:00.810
But—

09:00.810 --> 09:02.800
See that you do not talk back to me.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.820
Pick up the book and place it atop your head.

09:06.120 --> 09:08.690
Again, Leticia Dorman.

09:13.780 --> 09:15.110
Lower your hands.

09:19.330 --> 09:20.330
Again.

09:20.730 --> 09:21.580
Wuh?

09:22.010 --> 09:24.030
No crying. Again.

09:32.390 --> 09:34.750
Good morning, my lady.

09:34.750 --> 09:35.900
Good morning.

09:35.900 --> 09:37.520
Let's wash your face.

09:38.920 --> 09:40.230
Yes.

09:40.920 --> 09:43.300
First, you'll learn how to hold the spoon.

09:43.300 --> 09:48.570
Grasp twixt the middle and end of the handle
with your thumb, index, and middle fingers,

09:48.570 --> 09:50.750
and gently lift the spoon in that manner.

09:50.750 --> 09:51.970
Yes, ma'am.

09:51.970 --> 09:53.860
Keep your elbow in.

09:54.150 --> 09:58.100
Very good. Fill seven- to eight-tenths 
of the spoon's volume.

09:58.100 --> 10:00.640
Take care not to make any noise 
by hitting the bowl.

10:01.200 --> 10:02.870
That will not do!

10:03.980 --> 10:07.090
Your posture is poor, so start 
over from the beginning.

10:07.090 --> 10:08.950
Return the spoon.

10:08.950 --> 10:09.850
Yes, ma'am.

10:09.850 --> 10:12.350
Your posture should not change 
while eating the soup.

10:12.350 --> 10:14.640
You should only be raising 
and lowering your arm.

10:15.420 --> 10:17.470
Now, again.

10:17.470 --> 10:18.370
Yes, ma'am.

10:33.490 --> 10:36.600
This is because you haven't 
memorized the steps yet.

10:37.680 --> 10:40.080
Now stand up. Come on.

10:56.860 --> 10:59.600
Oh, I beg your pardon. Good morning.

10:59.910 --> 11:03.690
Good morning, Lily. 
It seems like fine weather again.

11:03.690 --> 11:05.600
I hope we can look forward to a pleasant day.

11:05.890 --> 11:07.830
As do I, my lady.

11:09.500 --> 11:11.650
Tuck your chin in more.

11:11.980 --> 11:15.740
You must learn what angle makes 
you look most attractive.

11:15.740 --> 11:16.940
My!

11:16.940 --> 11:17.950
Isn't she lovely?

11:17.950 --> 11:19.000
She really is.

11:19.000 --> 11:20.280
Very good.

11:20.280 --> 11:21.440
All right. Next.

11:21.990 --> 11:25.510
Greetings are the same. 
Move with beauty and grace.

11:25.510 --> 11:27.210
My!

11:27.210 --> 11:28.460
Next.

11:36.970 --> 11:38.600
Oh!

11:39.970 --> 11:41.250
My!

11:43.780 --> 11:47.480
We have an amicable relationship 
with the neighboring Kingdom of Delbaran.

11:48.310 --> 11:51.860
Do you recall the name of its current king?

11:51.860 --> 11:54.630
His Majesty Eric Antoine de Delbaran.

11:54.630 --> 11:59.490
Correct. He is very good friends 
with His Majesty King Morris of Astarl.

11:59.890 --> 12:04.930
Every year, they present each other 
with gifts on their birthdays.

12:05.630 --> 12:09.250
It is the fruit of many long 
years of tireless efforts

12:09.250 --> 12:11.000
that our world may now know peace.

12:11.760 --> 12:13.870
A most astute observation.

12:13.870 --> 12:17.260
Now then, let us study 
the history of our two kingdoms.

12:17.260 --> 12:18.510
Yes, ma'am.

13:10.740 --> 13:12.530
Look, it's Lady Leticia!

13:12.530 --> 13:14.060
What? Where is she?!

13:14.060 --> 13:17.460
Right over there! My, she's so lovely.

13:17.460 --> 13:19.870
It's no surprise she's betrothed
to Prince Clarke.

13:19.870 --> 13:23.320
She turns seventeen this year. 
I wonder if they'll be wed soon!

13:23.320 --> 13:24.800
Oh!

13:24.800 --> 13:26.280
How lovely!

13:24.800 --> 13:26.280
She's so beautiful.

13:27.160 --> 13:30.170
I'm sure it will be a grand,
 magnificent ceremony.

13:30.170 --> 13:31.920
I very much look forward to it!

13:37.480 --> 13:38.560
Brother.

13:38.560 --> 13:39.720
Leticia.

13:44.720 --> 13:45.790
Leticia.

13:49.590 --> 13:51.970
Allow me to introduce Lady Brianna Lariquel.

13:51.970 --> 13:54.770
Good day, Lady Leticia.

13:56.490 --> 13:57.770
Prince Clarke...

13:57.770 --> 13:58.790
What does this mean?

13:58.790 --> 14:00.780
Prince Clarke's with another woman?

14:01.240 --> 14:04.230
I cannot accompany you today.

14:04.230 --> 14:05.780
Do you mean to say...

14:05.780 --> 14:09.500
that this woman is your 
companion now, Prince Clarke?

14:10.240 --> 14:11.290
I'm sorry.

14:11.290 --> 14:14.790
Then does that mean that our engagement is...

14:17.140 --> 14:18.800
That's it exactly.

14:19.550 --> 14:21.550
That's it?

14:23.420 --> 14:25.050
That's it!

14:26.770 --> 14:28.390
That's what it means...

14:30.730 --> 14:32.390
Oh, did you think I was crying?

14:32.390 --> 14:33.560
Not a chance!

14:34.800 --> 14:39.520
Hurray!

14:39.520 --> 14:40.230
Huh?

14:40.230 --> 14:40.980
Eh?

14:40.980 --> 14:41.740
Hah?

14:41.740 --> 14:42.440
Hweh?

14:42.440 --> 14:44.540
What?!

14:44.540 --> 14:46.530
Hurray, hurray!

14:47.400 --> 14:49.080
Our engagement is finally off!

14:50.450 --> 14:53.710
Brother, did you hear that? 
You heard it, right?!

14:54.870 --> 14:56.460
Yeah, I heard.

14:57.120 --> 14:59.950
You'll keep your promise, won't you?

15:03.240 --> 15:06.430
Brother, I want to break off my engagement.

15:07.160 --> 15:09.930
This again? I told you it's impossible.

15:10.250 --> 15:14.090
No, there must be a way. Ask Father for me.

15:14.540 --> 15:17.180
He lacks the authority to do so.

15:17.180 --> 15:21.690
Devote yourself to your princess lessons
 so that you don't bring shame upon our family.

15:21.690 --> 15:23.440
You're such a dolt!

15:23.740 --> 15:24.940
And you're a pain!

15:25.760 --> 15:26.750
How dare you!

15:26.750 --> 15:28.010
How dare I?

15:31.330 --> 15:32.610
Gracious...

15:33.070 --> 15:33.870
Hmph.

15:36.410 --> 15:38.290
Please, I'm begging you.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.110
Not happening.

15:40.110 --> 15:43.750
But what if Prince Clarke 
fell in love with someone?

15:43.750 --> 15:46.050
You know that will never come to pass.

15:46.820 --> 15:51.180
When your parents arrange the marriage, 
I'm sure stuff like that happens.

15:53.470 --> 15:55.890
When it's arranged, perhaps...

15:55.890 --> 15:59.610
If Prince Clarke develops 
feelings for someone else,

15:59.610 --> 16:01.900
then I can break off our engagement, right?

16:02.320 --> 16:06.360
Should Prince Clarke actually fall in love
with someone else, then very well.

16:06.360 --> 16:08.410
Really? Do you mean it?

16:08.410 --> 16:09.290
Sure.

16:09.290 --> 16:10.530
That's a promise!

16:18.540 --> 16:20.040
Okay, fine.

16:20.040 --> 16:21.660
Hurray!

16:21.660 --> 16:24.100
Now I'm free! Free!

16:24.100 --> 16:25.670
What a wonderful feeling!

16:27.410 --> 16:28.560
Leticia?

16:30.550 --> 16:33.140
This is great! And it's all thanks to you!

16:33.140 --> 16:33.930
Huh?

16:34.270 --> 16:35.630
What was your name again?

16:35.630 --> 16:38.900
Um, Bri... Brie, Brie... Briea...

16:38.900 --> 16:39.730
Arowana?

16:39.730 --> 16:42.470
It's <i>Brianna</i>! Are you making fun of me?

16:42.470 --> 16:45.480
No, I would never make fun of you! 
I'm too grateful.

16:45.480 --> 16:48.340
Thank you for taking this 
bad debt off my hands!

16:48.340 --> 16:50.200
Bad debt?

16:50.560 --> 16:53.340
I've been studying etiquette
day in and day out.

16:53.340 --> 16:55.800
Walking, walking, walking, and walking...

16:55.800 --> 16:57.950
Sitting and standing, sitting and standing!

16:57.950 --> 16:59.460
Bowing and bowing!

16:59.740 --> 17:01.460
Nibbling on dainty little meals...

17:01.740 --> 17:06.330
Studying history, studying politics, 
studying economics...

17:06.960 --> 17:10.790
Dancing and dancing, 
drinking bellyfuls of tea...

17:10.790 --> 17:13.080
and enduring constant bullying 
from the nobles.

17:13.080 --> 17:14.130
Filthy country tramp.

17:15.380 --> 17:18.640
So for you to take all 
that burden onto yourself...

17:18.640 --> 17:20.480
Wait, what?

17:20.480 --> 17:22.250
I am forever grateful!

17:22.250 --> 17:24.180
Good luck, okay?! I'm rooting for you!

17:24.180 --> 17:25.090
Bye then!

17:25.090 --> 17:25.980
Hold on!

17:28.400 --> 17:30.290
Leticia, wait for me!

17:33.170 --> 17:34.950
Prince Clarke...

17:35.420 --> 17:36.700
Please listen to me.

17:36.700 --> 17:39.200
Thank you for everything!

17:39.200 --> 17:40.210
Huh?

17:40.210 --> 17:44.240
I couldn't be happier! I do wish you'd
broken off the engagement sooner

17:44.240 --> 17:48.240
so I wouldn't have had to waste so much
 time here, but all is well now!

17:48.240 --> 17:50.970
I'll keep all my negative thoughts 
to myself, so worry not!

17:50.970 --> 17:52.100
Leticia!

17:52.100 --> 17:55.760
I'm moving far away, 
so feel free to be with whomever,

17:55.760 --> 18:00.250
sire as many offspring as you want, 
and bring prosperity to your kingdom!

18:00.250 --> 18:02.230
Now then, farewell!

18:04.640 --> 18:06.480
Dorman family carriage, come on!

18:15.330 --> 18:17.490
Lily! Lily!

18:17.900 --> 18:21.560
Welcome home, my lady. 
What on earth is the matter?

18:21.560 --> 18:22.620
We're moving!

18:23.610 --> 18:24.390
Excuse me?

18:24.390 --> 18:27.110
Happiness comes when you least expect it.

18:27.110 --> 18:29.880
Have you hit your head, my lady?

18:29.880 --> 18:31.550
You're not going to believe this!

18:31.550 --> 18:36.000
My engagement to Prince Clarke, 
the eldest heir to the Kingdom of Astarl,

18:36.000 --> 18:38.860
has finally been broken off!

18:38.860 --> 18:41.640
I can scarcely believe Prince Clarke
 would permit that.

18:41.640 --> 18:43.390
I've been suffering since I was seven.

18:43.390 --> 18:45.700
Every little thing I've done has been criticized.

18:45.700 --> 18:49.720
"Don't laugh so loud. You'll bother someone." 
Come on, who'd be bothered by laughter?

18:49.720 --> 18:53.130
I can't run because it's unladylike?
You just want something to complain about!

18:53.130 --> 18:56.660
My lady, it's true that you are 
foul-mouthed and not very ladylike.

18:56.660 --> 19:00.130
But now, at last, I've been freed of all that.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.410
So let's move!

19:01.410 --> 19:02.640
Where to?

19:02.640 --> 19:06.610
I haven't decided yet. 
The middle of nowhere would be nice.

19:07.520 --> 19:10.050
Oh, Brother. How lovely 
to see you home so early.

19:10.800 --> 19:12.050
Welcome back, my lord.

19:12.050 --> 19:14.270
Pity about the broken engagement, huh?

19:14.270 --> 19:15.590
How aggravating.

19:15.590 --> 19:19.440
Good luck finding another way 
to cozy up to the royal family.

19:19.440 --> 19:23.680
My lord, my lady...
 Please do try to get along.

19:27.740 --> 19:30.150
I think we should move to Aberta Village.

19:30.150 --> 19:31.480
What's that?

19:31.480 --> 19:33.400
Our country home in Aberta!

19:33.400 --> 19:35.250
You don't need to yell, you know?

19:35.250 --> 19:36.780
But Aberta Village, huh?

19:36.780 --> 19:40.670
One of the Dorman duchy's countryside 
estates, with rivers and forests!

19:40.670 --> 19:43.160
You sure are a quick thinker, Brother!

19:43.160 --> 19:45.530
Okay, we're going to Aberta!

19:45.530 --> 19:48.310
I want to leave in the morning, 
so we'd best get ready!

19:48.310 --> 19:51.200
My lady, it may take several days to pack.

19:51.200 --> 19:54.910
We'll only take what we need. 
And one more thing, Lily...

19:54.910 --> 19:57.380
I will not prepare you a snack 
at so late an hour.

19:57.380 --> 19:58.430
Not that!

19:58.940 --> 20:02.640
Aberta is out in the country, 
and we don't have much help there.

20:02.640 --> 20:05.640
It will be a far humbler life 
than what we've had here,

20:06.040 --> 20:07.690
but will you come with us?

20:07.690 --> 20:11.920
Of course. It would be my pleasure 
to accompany you, my lady.

20:11.920 --> 20:13.310
Lily!

20:16.550 --> 20:18.100
So you'll stay with me forever?

20:18.100 --> 20:19.950
I wouldn't go that far.

23:19.920 --> 23:39.940
<b>Next Time</b>

23:20.040 --> 23:25.070
I thought you and Prince Clarke would make a perfect couple

23:20.920 --> 23:25.930
Heeheehee, now I'm free forever

23:21.920 --> 23:26.930
Let it cool a little before you eat it

23:22.920 --> 23:27.930
That seems like fun

23:23.920 --> 23:28.930
I can't believe this is happening! I can't believe them!

23:25.930 --> 23:30.930
It's great for royals to get out in nature

23:27.300 --> 23:32.310
Unfortunately, there is no love between me and the princess

23:28.800 --> 23:33.810
Quit stomping your feet when you run. It's rude

23:30.300 --> 23:35.310
Would you stop ignoring me for once?

23:31.810 --> 23:36.810
I like the red one better

23:37.270 --> 23:39.940
I'm telling you, when it's just the ladies...
